<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Entry received</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='style.css') }}">
<style>
  .confirm-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--ink);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .confirm-box { max-width: 420px; }
  .confirm-box .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .confirm-box h1 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .confirm-box p { color: #c7c9d1; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 2rem; }
  .confirm-box a {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--amber-soft);
    padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 7px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="confirm-page">
  <div class="confirm-box">
    <span class="eyebrow">Entry logged</span>
    <h1>You're on the roster.</h1>
    <p>Your details and resume have been recorded. We'll be in touch if there's a fit for the rate and role you shared.</p>
    <a href="{{ url_for('index') }}">Submit another entry</a>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
